      "cooked": "<p>Fine everyone, i’ll just tell you all what Absolute Zero’s nemesis is. It is the ocean itself. It has a vast amount of minions at its disposal which include Sharks, Whales, and Ocotopi. (This is all a fabrication, Absolute Zero’s nemesis has nothing to do with Aquatic Correspondence, but I did infact ask Christopher if Absolute Zero’s Nemesis was the Eel. In which I got a answer of maybe it is or maybe it isn’t.)</p>",
