      "cooked": "<p>Just met Christopher at Kantcon and I can’t thank him enough for the time he spent demoing the game to me and my family… We played a full game and had blast talking with him and his assistant and enjoying some sweet dinosaur sounds  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\">   For a guy with a hit game and some very impressive Kick Starter Campaigns he could not have been more humble and down to earth - plus he was so enthusiastic it was infectious… If I did not know better I would have sworn this was his first con!</p>\n<p>Needless to say we bought the game - he tried in vain to talk us out of it with the new version coming out shortly with better card quality, a new box, markers, etc. etc.  We just couldn’t wait - plus he was good enough to pose for a picture and sign it for us…</p>\n<p>I heard so much about this game on the the Dice Tower - it was great to finally get to give it go…</p>\n<p>Sincere thanks to Christopher for making our weekend!</p>\n<p>Dave Williams and Family</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:08:16.313Z",
