      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Just met Christopher at Kantcon and I can't thank him enough for the time he spent demoing the game to me and my family... We played a full game and had blast talking with him and his assistant and enjoying some sweet dinosaur sounds  :)   For a guy with a hit game and some very impressive Kick Starter Campaigns he could not have been more humble and down to earth - plus he was so enthusiastic it was infectious... If I did not know better I would have sworn this was his first con!\n\nNeedless to say we bought the game - he tried in vain to talk us out of it with the new version coming out shortly with better card quality, a new box, markers, etc. etc.  We just couldn't wait - plus he was good enough to pose for a picture and sign it for us...\n\nI heard so much about this game on the the Dice Tower - it was great to finally get to give it go... \n\nSincere thanks to Christopher for making our weekend!\n\nDave Williams and Family",
