      "created_at": "2012-07-08T05:14:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To quote the Soldier from TF2:</p>\n<p>“Now THAT is what I wanna see!” It’s great to see that so many other people are so enthusiastic about the game! I’m not even involved in making it or anything – I’ve never even met any of the creators – yet I feel proud whenever I hear this kind of story.</p>\n<p>Maybe it’s because hearing about other people liking what I like makes me feel validated. I don’t know.</p>",
