      "created_at": "2012-07-08T05:56:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;LtSterling&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"LtSterling\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just met Christopher at Kantcon and I can’t thank him enough for the time he spent demoing the game to me and my family… We played a full game and had blast talking with him and his assistant and enjoying some sweet dinosaur sounds  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">   For a guy with a hit game and some very impressive Kick Starter Campaigns he could not have been more humble and down to earth - plus he was so enthusiastic it was infectious… If I did not know better I would have sworn this was his first con!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Christopher certainly can make the game ever more fun than it already is. It would be fun to have a sound track of him reading off cards and such that people can use whenever they are playing a game to get that feel for everyone game. Or I could start doing it myself, but i’m not sure I can reach his level of entertainment.</p>",
